{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 135,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a2708518f7030d3b08f221d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喧哗上等！放马过来！有这首歌的话绝对不会输！\\n把你们全部都弄得头冒金星！……这就是充满如此气概的灵魂之曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "126e6e92def6be6adb0f4a1f40f084f4d135c95f25e616c0357ed4333ec61ad8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1160"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a69ca3c67cd5df11f121121",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找未知的“某物”——为了触动心灵深处。\\n那么，今天要度过怎样的一天呢？一边听这首歌一边思考吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5a8700d4892614cc7c8bded3bef4e414d92959597513a7e90fb0c5a36a2458d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4e07d4aebcbf0bf95c9f45b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那段时光里不变的热血梦想，凝聚成这一曲。定能传递给每一个人！\\n脚下的大地虽不同，但仰望的星空却是同一片！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9845ef97d776adf87dd40f76e9b6ee1188fb6035462e0dea20b3613624b058db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1162"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc4904b85075c945c5aaf61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刻骨铭心，一生都无法消逝的景色————\\n“爱”往往就是如此之物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fcbfc73cec9fa3f54b824d22c4bfc97f30b07cc6154e5640fda22f8a9b4633d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1163"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d118827b55e4807780023b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了清白正直，让我们忍耐吧。严于律己，\\n唯有自制。忍耐才是美德。是的，听了这首歌就会明白。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba58c507e871bc5d510a390c22bb40dd27fba3c7d13ebf5726b6c51d98a17f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1164"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d517c4e1a11a67b09264a8f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "万物所向披靡的优雅旋律，是胜者的绝对证明！\\n 她的道路无人能挡！只因任何事物在她面前都如微风一般！",
      "source_fingerprint": "279e8266208df5b9898cca31a8a03d4d3108fd7ed403a5256d277e854cdadef9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1165"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db6aa96856d625004baabacf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随心所欲，随风而去，飞向遥远的彼方！\\n若想知晓风的去向，聆听这首曲子便好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e4f9f90703a4fbce1ac659e498a22e099726259e03fc7805fe3ca2d3814977",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1166"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:878a58b2c9d9a7184d2fca7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "太阳正在地平线的某处升起……只是并非此处。\\n奔跑吧。总有一天，这片阴云也会散去的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99301dff80f85a39826c71a529a90d86f47d6e8ca7afd247c00feaf4eb988d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1167"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6bc73d7042725b4d5cb2cdc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跪拜聆听！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01a45ddd47190dd605ff10534746b38f4445acf5dbe1eb7223fc4b2bb8e52034",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1168"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aeacd594255264ae4c4127d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "旅途中拾起的风景，将成为连接未来的梦想。\\n那么，今晚又会做怎样的梦呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d166a88f224e103b6db8cf966a06f3894f8450c2244ce374dbc53558cb653c08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1169"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631e62c8a7473069e194a24f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有一种光芒让人无法移开目光。\\n只要听这首曲子——不，其实你已经知道了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "84c1069438893b8b342f49be79a0fbcd74beaebfae1db7b7b55fe46b95dc74dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1170"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f7c18bc56606e1deecc2165",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "辉煌梦想的顶峰遥不可及，前路充满绝望……\\n然后，少女走向了荣华之门。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c63fb5e5fc8c077ffd924bd72837f270315103a34fbdc432f65fff6d1d6b6e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d377f13b8f6d61a5da77bd7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "争先恐后超越他人的背影！\\n燃烧的热情终将成为照亮新时代的灯火！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddcf1d5230d4828111729dca81c545cb8c92f21c7ecee16cf5822fbb41b8588a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1172"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3a6a5d3c19639d9bd123d27",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "奔跑吧，Frontier！用震撼的全力疾奔撼动世界！\\n来吧，究竟是谁将开辟全新的世界！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "31bfa0f750cc4c0261397fc7f8043ca9d504fe02b566b0ae120dd066c3e278fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45bccc91862cf3a2f91a404b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在夕阳余晖下的归途，某天突然溢出的旋律。\\n\n不可思议地，声音重叠着传来……就像那一天一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a0cb889eb3f274423dc57723cb5906a514a3a3348772f60170bb5edcb447303",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31be97cde28fff86030e9b16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一起奔跑的日子。不知不觉已经来到了这么远的地方。\\n并肩奔跑的两人的牵绊，将一直延续到梦想的尽头——",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb31f9039a1867f66a6b02cd63cde340fd54566f07d4833d860f5ebba37cfd7a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1175"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78c5fe72d01388b878619089",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "划破风暴的，是你那举世无双的光芒——\\n披挂上阵吧，在那缤纷绚烂的色彩中。鸣响吧，那革命的歌声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9e57f10d99f84b70df7259ea1d79ff1cc8fdc1480777f125476c217d6d949b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1176"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d2071440960643b1aa7f2ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在这场豪华绚丽的盛典中，证明出团队的羁绊。\n以此团结之力攀登世界之巅！拿下吧，美国梦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3049ae23595807548430a941542d8affaebc1af8f855bee2fedebe145e7713d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78225a9b059a49631af7cee8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想要比任何人都要强烈、激烈，闪耀如流星般的一曲！\\n掠过天际的灰色轨迹，将会震撼每一个人的心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ea5a311120350b01b2e5e126f197395e02124bdc9ef578334c4ce980a2aadb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1178"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d37c2e6a3046d139960ab588",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不善于使用言语表达……即便如此，还是想要传达出来。\\n就是这样，一首稍微有点笨拙的歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9200df9f4e31ab61ab761352bfa7b58f487e5898d0073bb2df8f169045744fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1179"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:181cc577cf445e3c42dfc61d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赠予你的这一碗。面条、配菜与热情，\\n盛满平日里满满的感谢——嘿，让您久等啦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "505c5b425c9c1f6aea176c1aceec6b0ec5737c508b5a4a4ffed834da334ebdb9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:996c7568e8341c51f3593486",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『#kawaii』『#梦幻柔软』『#心动不已？』\\n可爱是能传达到宇宙的暗号！呐，可以再多喜欢我一点吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "410a1d5da43efff3a849005af5e013bf077ba6e7dbd5d0d32f6041d35c4f9657",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1182"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c9f68bc65e67e485df90050",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "高涨的心跳已经无法抑制！ \\n毫无保留地倾诉炽热的思念，一首让人心跳加速的歌曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a525512dfe02bc7cae1075026fa2cd5d2986b8e82552815abe5ae72293e3aae0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79dfc863223b14a2e4f300f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "灵魂为之震颤，歌颂着骄傲不屈的乐曲。\\n绝不会轻易屈服，直到成为“女王”的那一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e1eb37482eefe949d29706f459830f31bbd17a64c4ad188500011b431a96e3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1184"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:524e9bf9062d0bcfb924af3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拜托了♡正因为是你，我才会这么想撒娇。\\n连全世界都会为之着迷的，可爱的流行歌曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "525912bcfb92b78bbe7a757d8f429cf8d1ba8bc7bda5a94d92455959be5e95c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1185"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d65627bcaaf9193b139f920",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "注入了能一扫无聊日常的特别魔法的乐曲！\\n只需要相信的心。仅凭这一点——无论什么都一定能做到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea4b7c44c0aff35bf60f78c44fad18c1deb9a5e5aac5d8c87e94bdc9fd63109d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1186"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896b56be0adb3987b5b003f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "华丽、优雅、勇敢！点燃内心的充满力量的乐曲！\\n无论遇到什么困难都不会屈服——这才是公主应有的姿态！",
      "source_fingerprint": "627c7ddfd31ec59005af6b6f9ed19832c194148bcfdc62f5d08f26f005512730",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1187"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:669639e3259b83e521ee782a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在“永恒”之中，闪耀的一曲。\\n距离实现曾与你许下的约定，只差一步之遥……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16dd18b1aaa2624ecb33d5f6535fb8afea22446a23f81186ea6f109223925a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a00c6870d60b8d30cfad059",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无数深深刻下的蹄印。它们终将编织出历史——\\n正因如此，我也要前行。因为这足迹，将通往创世。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f979a6b3ee4abda7c414ae0701e397b566c12e331611655d2b198d8eb7ade4df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21ac70eddf577f31a7e0b58b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "传递☆我们的全力应援！将最大力量献给你♪\\n我们相信！你就是最强！！直到极限Pom Pon!!!",
      "source_fingerprint": "55e8a62e33f722cf8d0583ad8cec355288f2bb584d26ed2e5d2262402b44ead1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08981739c2141836ff82ae17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "三姐妹依偎在一起的和声，温柔地抚慰着心灵——\\n让歌声与思念重叠吧。即便道路不同，我们永远相伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f7c4320d72326928aeb745d027513123f087fcbebe37d79ffeff29b23d3d84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5211f4e063be40a6a9173da2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "寄宿着觉悟的少女们，坚定不移的决心之曲。\\n因为宿敌赋予了我们力量——无论到哪里，都一起前行吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb53245b325ebfca1516edec8af4086451cfb887970e6ac7601443e18e2185f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aafe15d2df6fdfd97742c4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做好觉悟吧。只要听过一次，\\n就会烙印在耳膜与灵魂深处，挥之不去的黄金旋律。",
      "source_fingerprint": "620f5fa19ff1345168acb8061fb065806157800c0edd889f0198b2ed8abd816f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc41793eb087de97f115375",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐，今晚也要互诉心声吗？我们要传达的可是彼此的爱。\\n打开社区的大门——就是Love me♡Love you♡哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb6834dc87892265787d83a03e5093e067978927759489246e65b0dacb554f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ab7d697ef6ed2a84a96f6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所需要的，是一点点勇气。即使害怕，只要描绘出来就一定会改变。\\n因为不想只停留在想象中——就迈出脚步吧，趁现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ba97c4f5a9e7a4211f229648fa6054a5b58ff5e4d968c9765d561ff152ab3b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00caaf81ef1bfdc530de2be7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呜呼哦哦哦！尊爆赛马娘酱的坑来啦━(ﾟ∀ﾟ)━！！\\n感谢与推相遇的奇迹！祈求全推幸福世界最尊！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4174052e79016932d7dd7b0f63ac278b2904480a2322a4894775e102ddb2ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbe180fe7755e28db53c660",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请，轻轻地牵起彼此的手。因为那份温暖，会化作\\n思念的圆环——为了能传达到所有孤独之人的心中，倾注祈愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a4f61df378b5f4621ca2073fe7e36dcd375b5b99f736ad896590df45b3fb22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2fcc97a3c212eb39816e0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跑完英里达成我的哩规则！满面笑容这就登场！\\n比任何人都想要闪耀的这个舞台，唯独第一绝不让步！Go Go 英里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a8bf8f99b4424ae00137fc3f8962c1c2017dce9aa53c73aeba34fbb542b461f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc08dd262784c96efb2d49f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "伴随着直指顶点的热情节拍，狂热度达到最高潮！\\n来吧，去超越极限，为了在全新的舞台上闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ff127602f78156f3dbde7f7f36ae691730f811706be800bc488c0564a1eb9cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21f605c63854c903cd62da6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐，愿意带我走吗？前往我所未知的崭新世界！\\n若这只是泡沫般的片刻——那就如做梦一般，踏上旅途吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d632644e126ffd28fe3e652bd793bf2e39fc1eacbbbe45225b0fc13e5b23ae01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f307f697da4527aeb4ed2e2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "气氛嗨到爆！情绪拉到满！趴体・Party・fu～♪\\n果然还是辣妹YYDS对吧♪毕竟今天的主角可是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f93468050cbe0a90a6bc6cade0be164a9390fdab7481f3c5eec67b137a92474",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e5c0ffaae0244dfe287bf58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在怀旧的旋律中，回想起的是黄金般的心象。\\n自由的旅人未曾停下脚步——无论谁，都会对那段旅途心怀梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faca9261ad3069a4d790ff629f2d61360662f3d1ad256b8c73250134dca73570",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8b1bda58646dbca4f82be52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要想夺取顶点就绝不妥协。顺从本能，将其粉碎吧！\\n咆哮吧——刻印在新时代之上，那才是最强的证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1934605b6aee88cd9af2df4c3b44828d688d3310f1eea48072858f27e329cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:407aec1b218e99a19d7916a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正因为有劲敌们在，新时代才得以开辟。\\n如果有想要抵达的地方——那就一起奔跑吧，前往终幕的彼方",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c51041d9dec2064f5fec1eef8e151e8f6585240c80b791ec023190fdfe2577d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c01e630106062933a24c66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "突然开播的新闻节目「スタホTV」的BGM。\\n听到这首歌的话，就关注一下StarHorse4的最新情报吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff88f1c8d4bc85f005c4e63ef50a47ef3e37c4a8b6e6fcd2a150345dd4aa3579",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb0b462dec6ce7483d1984c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说到StarHorse的条件战就想到融合音乐。\\n能感受到系列正统进化的歌曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e9c32024270140aff8895e2b03c1e9bf097039ad5675d6f969594d0544d6c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d5451e20e0ad9ba8c9eab1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出道时若播放这首歌将备受瞩目！\\n在StarHorse4中听见这首歌是玩家的目标之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab4aa25cbb30474e38d07f5289e1111931509561165e6397ff7a91783ba98f37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3ef29ce6fdf321ce57e473",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于StarHorse4的生产环节播放的BGM。\\n是能够慢慢思考自己专属血统表的曲风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "804813b23274f0fa5464d3699b9159a183052c8de67dd6a6580f7ec0c89094ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:841806db2b66318ec21ab8ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于StarHorse4的生产环节播放的BGM。\\n随着成长过程与影片一同欣赏十分令人心满意足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c06fe6197c37523036962e78d55dbdc087937b5b39d0ced60f322e9cc515b3f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f3111e6b58d38db3678e5dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズ春の１曲。\\nそのハーモニーは新たな生命の息吹を感じさせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffc003000aad4224b69f71a58420ec0a6b3a06fdbd3457e7fdde3bdc54c4d9e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8506"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a20b550318ee5cde16fe76d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズ夏の１曲。\\nそのリズムは降り注ぐ太陽の煌きを感じさせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac8325932e171f1c380e956e9db5eab38d4f7e647e5822ac67d0bebbdc0a47e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8507"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c684e9076ead3727b6a3faf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズ秋の１曲。\\n切ないラインは美しい紅葉の騒めきを感じさせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3d72961f3fde3fafe83fda23f14c4d63384013f90231f4d87f8a5f73d8967a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8508"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0b5e7b0ff57c90f0490b59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズ冬の１曲。\\n繊細な旋律は白銀に染まる冬暁を感じさせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5daa0b17d296e0404b824efa6c464688de030df1d78ee8cf645fd99cb040cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8509"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50880d9e7494a9e76faf7c62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズの超決戦で流れるＢＧＭ。\\n決意と共に白熱する激闘の熱気を感じさせる１曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb1c122dfb6ded7cd31470b7137297c19a15506808366ec69074539ab7a3aea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8510"
      ]
